# Allow-list: the build context is only what the image needs. Secrets (.env),
# caches (.cache/), generated output, private notes and git metadata can never
# leak into a layer. To ship a new file, add it here explicitly.
# (docker/sandbox/ is built with its own context and is not affected by this file.)
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
